## Interface: 11200
## Title: Azeroth FieldKit
## Version: 0.4.2
## Author: Kevin Radlowski (Maidenhead); derived from MASH by Malk
## Notes: Azeroth Survivors helper (/fieldkit): elite-only nameplates, chronicle boss bars + schedule timeline, health bar with shield, buffs and low health warning, crits, stats, gold and chest price, accessories, tabbed meter with sort/hide/heal done-recv/party drill/pet DoT tips, chests on the minimap, lairs, camera.
